        <!--
            T622 — local (in-process) ONNX embeddings. Provides
            org.springframework.ai.embedding.TransformersEmbeddingModel, which
            runs a sentence-transformers model (default all-MiniLM-L6-v2, 384-dim)
            via Microsoft ONNX Runtime + DJL HuggingFace tokenizers — no external
            embedding API/key. Used by the "TRANSFORMERS_LOCAL" embedding-model
            provider type (TurLocalEmbeddingModelFactory) so the public demo can
            ground chat with a zero-cost, offline-after-download embedding model.
            The .onnx/tokenizer.json are fetched from HTTPS on first init and
            cached; the demo warms this at startup. Version managed by spring-ai-bom.
